{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "d59eaae14f5b7530c9fdb98da598277347fe87822e8b101dd40bfb52cd717180", "ja": "君だから", "zh": "正因为是你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ce4d565c26912acbb5b7089f0e05f1fd649645ed659a0b4f44f6a0e6bd8cb382", "ja": "記念公演が終わった。静かになったステージ\nで、プロデューサーと社長はお互いの思いを\n語り合う。やがて小鳥と美咲も現れ、裏方だ\nけのささやかな祝杯をあげるのだった。", "zh": "纪念公演结束了。制作人与社长在安静下来的舞台上，互诉彼此的心声。不久，小鸟和美咲也出现了，幕后工作人员们举起了属于自己的小小庆功杯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c6daf2ca0a6e6efb0182ee9dd8eb8be7ef5462dd083b49a4a67bc6464d9710f", "ja": "（記念公演のステージが、すべて終わった。\n終わってしまうと、あっという間だな……）", "zh": "（纪念公演的舞台，已经全部结束了。\n一旦结束，时间过得真快啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1001_president", "source_sha256": "6ddc07bc836c7f524681e9e19f0b4eada5fa381de06dc5d419328b43c60adc78", "ja": "お疲れ様。\nやはりここにいたね。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n你果然在这里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1002_p", "source_sha256": "334bcf84b8d6c35d89c4916bd895dd6d306aff5c7e0da37759e2142cecb3a0ef", "ja": "あっ、社長！\nどうしてここだと……。", "zh": "啊，社长！\n您怎么知道我在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1003_president", "source_sha256": "8de692a8ffb7222a53c084b9d0d4abd90e3a02037fd0f3edaefee798da2ffecc", "ja": "なに、私も昔はそうだったからね。大きなライブの後は\nこうして空のステージを見つめていたものさ。", "zh": "哎呀，我以前也是这样的。大型演唱会结束后，\n总是会像这样凝视着空无一人的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1004_president", "source_sha256": "1b71eb925f3b7b7286f0802e3cc66e8dd8f559e3802aed5663a1621d61cfbe5e", "ja": "自分の手で育てたアイドルを、\nまた必ずこの舞台に立たせてみせる……。", "zh": "我一定会亲手培养出偶像，\n让她再次登上这个舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1005_president", "source_sha256": "ef89e8e7663ea52caab73b4f27d6b243137ceabf209cd1f54e16ce68c8e36257", "ja": "君も、そうなんじゃないかと思ってね。", "zh": "我心想，你应该也是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1006_p", "source_sha256": "110cd0079aa5d8bb38267d40cd645bcfe6c7bd381519603267d3e0c2d1c31ad4", "ja": "自分も、そう思っています。\nけど……。", "zh": "我也是这么想的。\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1007_president", "source_sha256": "01e27ccd98d36205e0b1486f54fd4d68d795bb1a43a761d0233c6d9f74e4304e", "ja": "何か、不安でもあるのかね？", "zh": "有什么不安的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1008_p", "source_sha256": "25d0944a46ab6ce9fee04f429d1ee0ae31d402f5cf8da2fb1a784907a564ef83", "ja": "時々ですが……彼女達をプロデュースするのが、\n自分で、本当に良かったのかと思う事があります。", "zh": "虽然只是偶尔……但我有时会想，\n由我来担任她们的制作人，真的好吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f7c947799c58b79c4a92be2d8e078ff8e5995337024abd106a4f5b266c789b9c", "ja": "他に、もっといいやり方があったんじゃないかと\n考えたり。……今さらですが。", "zh": "有时会想，是不是换作其他做法会更好。\n……虽然现在说这些也有些晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1010_president", "source_sha256": "05abc11302692e36446ee292529141a49afd5da29ea83ec49b320e706983ea8f", "ja": "ふむ。今日に至るまでの間、君にもアイドル諸君にも、\n様々な出来事があったと思うが……。", "zh": "嗯。我想直到今天为止，无论是对你还是对各位偶像而言，\n都经历过各种各样的事情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1011_president", "source_sha256": "750d4125f6e0901b319105a48a382c557dde2124ff409cd5574ccda32e26ad33", "ja": "アイドルを助け、また彼女達の成長にも助けられ、\n君達は互いに、かけがえのない存在になっている。", "zh": "你帮助着偶像，也被她们的成长所拯救，\n你们彼此之间，已成为不可替代的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1012_president", "source_sha256": "07e7f64e136dafe805c15cbe6a292413bb80fcec8844277ca81418f9b1cd3d6f", "ja": "私は、そう確信しているよ。", "zh": "我是这么确信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4fdb77ff55afa3b84240437febe2a21dc2b82f065bb892a85fec412a96d794e2", "ja": "社長……。", "zh": "社长……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1014_president", "source_sha256": "ca24c6f778ea366c90c203141d853a6602b9e3d58a4acfa4a3171125923b5e03", "ja": "それに、たとえどんな優秀なプロデューサーが\n現れたとしても、だ。", "zh": "而且，就算出现了多么优秀的制作人，也是一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1015_president", "source_sha256": "db1e624d0283cc56b64147ee02e55e1d2e33f561423c42b7412c93a73aab4d4d", "ja": "君自身が、他の誰かに、彼女達を任せられるかね？\nたとえば……そう、私とか！", "zh": "你能放心地把她们托付给其他人吗？\n比如说……对，像我这样的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f7b770590439d6b7f887d42a3d74fdc572469e2198ead750d96eccb25dbead0d", "ja": "ええっ！！？", "zh": "诶诶！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1017_president", "source_sha256": "a71e400d7c8a7f47eb27a471d1c3daa9fd4c71c71ae0f2e1b6216f9a6e470b05", "ja": "ははっ。冗談だよ、冗談！　これからも、\n現場の事は君に任せる。これまで通りにね！", "zh": "哈哈。开玩笑的，开玩笑！今后\n现场的事也交给你了。就像之前那样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1018_president", "source_sha256": "c99e1aae6008f72d9a6c88d5f3d76ff7315ee859341168fec690ed0c444b7747", "ja": "でないと間違いなく、私が怒られてしまうだろう。\n当のアイドル諸君にね。", "zh": "否则的话，我肯定会被骂的吧。\n被偶像诸君骂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1019_president", "source_sha256": "0373b2584824adcf6079d8f09c66072bc60c8ec99b1badd5c75b5b52a90ecac0", "ja": "というわけで、君！　引き続き我が765プロの\n大切なアイドル諸君を、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "话已至此，你！我们765艺能\n宝贵的偶像诸君，之后也拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2b52edece35da919ebd208d4d2292e504327ebfef29e553a8f1d089f22aeec08", "ja": "……はいっ！\nこれからも、精いっぱい努めます！", "zh": "……好的！\n今后我也会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "0291b1c08e199cb1359d1f4528f24a4f7e6c98b9f2e7f782462f04e34cdab4a0", "ja": "社長、{$P$}さん。\nこんなところにいたんですね。", "zh": "社长、{$P$}先生。\n你们原来在这里呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1022_p", "source_sha256": "02aec045860aae29550b4cac3272201edd848b7e3bf1c8fe592dc7c769447a49", "ja": "あっ、音無さん！　青羽さんも。", "zh": "啊，音无小姐！青羽小姐也在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1023_102mis", "source_sha256": "c6dbf091f29b3a0d00fe603799e17626f3187f09e89a6ed5e9455f3c3fb67382", "ja": "社長さん！　頼まれていた準備、整いました！\nいつでもOKですよ♪", "zh": "社长！您吩咐的准备工作，都已经弄好了！\n随时都可以开始哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1024_president", "source_sha256": "914942bcdb8b1f9f7f8c7ace7746426e8260d4c76c8a34446aabb5ab0b6f430c", "ja": "おお、そうか！　いやはや、\n君達に任せてしまってすまなかったね。", "zh": "哦哦，这样啊！哎呀呀，\n全都交托给你们，真是不好意思啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0bb7aecdbb7fd3aa86ef228f393cc3805bf3ceecbaed3b959aeabc43f1915d10", "ja": "準備ですか？", "zh": "是准备工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "e67290be796e9170829ec365618be78f5bd60068848e58dc7635873c219147d7", "ja": "はい！　社長の提案で、\n裏方の私たちだけで、ささやかな祝杯です♪", "zh": "是的！社长提议，\n让我们这些幕后人员先稍微庆祝一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1027_102mis", "source_sha256": "f037a700f0c70d9f07657e711a5e113a61558212d428025ae1f6817e64c63da7", "ja": "といっても、乾杯するだけですけど……えへへ。\n終わったらみんなと合流して、打ち上げですよ♪", "zh": "虽说如此，其实也只是干个杯而已啦……诶嘿嘿。\n等这边结束了，就去和大家汇合办庆功宴哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1028_president", "source_sha256": "534e214133c944a508fc8c62741ffc6d916b0970841302a77860af9db219ad1f", "ja": "それでは、諸君。この度の記念公演の成功と、\nこれからの、我が765プロの未来のために！", "zh": "那么，诸位。为了这次纪念公演的成功，\n也为了我们765艺能今后的未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1029_president", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1031_102mis", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_14_1032_p", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
